rn higher scores by destroying goblins in the most ridiculous ways!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340180/extras/86217e2af46beff16f6e13af86d3e88e.poster.avif?t=1730309733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340180/extras/86217e2af46beff16f6e13af86d3e88e.webm?t=1730309733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340180/extras/86217e2af46beff16f6e13af86d3e88e.mp4?t=1730309733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340180/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.poster.avif?t=1730309733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340180/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.webm?t=1730309733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340180/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.mp4?t=1730309733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
